      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 latency by route",
      "description": "95th percentile per route. The dashed line is the orders latency SLO (95 % of POST /v1/orders under 300 ms); it applies to that route only. Quantiles from classic histograms are interpolated inside a bucket, so read them as \"between two bucket edges\".",
